+        "",
+        "**MEASURED.** Writes are confined to `box/bigrows-20260903/` and this report. No ledger, `jc2-lean`, `ideation-*`, or named in-progress lane file is edited by the driver.",
+        "",
+        "**MEASURED.** `%s`." % summary["singular"],
+        "",
+        "## Driver",
+        "",
